{"48d6411b": {"d": 5.776, "e": "AVrq8+6rgP/gz9m5mZuputDNwaBpL0TF1LqUdzQIAXu1UdZxmtTOzbJsORg/o/TRrHZ9587MnGSltoiGsOjUsXloXzwRBQEAAAAgePT4z5FhS0EkL6irYVGp3oqaTz/a9uDHnaKsfCpEUMyEUDl2VlA0GAc=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Can you hear me in the last row? If you can't, please raise your hand. … Yes, I see the flaw in that system.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d7ac031068cad2a2"}, "75237a62": {"d": 4.333, "e": "B37r3dGrT2TY7c6pcTUKYreraj5Wm2pXLgwEAABE1v/HhVbEkTu/wLm7sJeks7aojVaixsePOJObikWjip3IwYlxZY+CcIx7Tk+UocG1i1E8R3JgQiAJ", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "One, two … testing. The microphone and I are both on probation this semester.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "6954b8c5b73e25ff"}, "af1a0df6": {"d": 5.64, "e": "A5fimFLI0WxQ2NfAq5hoMZLS39Bssbmvycm4m0ZPh3pDV8by5NKieFlEJQoBAAAAsv/43LqzXl9cUCTd39jNnnZQRSCiLo3ZwqiGWM7mpD9/hXJsToAtnuaaIlQlbbJPqoofRIKpu7ZzQzh3WSkrHwo=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Is this on? The little light is green. In my experience that means nothing, but let's be optimistic.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "33794b923b89d2d9"}, "befaee23": {"d": 4.365, "e": "Dp7th0V9/+nZ0LVrKsjQ2+G4w71ajoaeZGaH7L21harU3LR6Si0UBAEAETM+0tjOzL23kmEiEiDR2e2cRUSbh3Rn7ODg3Ye6t6yBT4bo0q1dXoFKHzUVCg==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Back row, thumbs up if it's loud enough. … Thumbs. Thank you. Very democratic.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "e5e4ff85460094b5"}, "8f41553c": {"d": 5.414, "e": "Csv8jfnycZjK4djgoc3V7MheZdV5QuzJrYlxRhgEAACb+6LNOK7auXxi0M6sezbY12BUUTzt8f7VY2fbeUTy0LWbi1YUBcPHwuRDiff68PWupZmIbDhb9Z4veGz/tbFp5vZuNjiDe15fPjgQBw==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Let me try the microphone. If it crackles, that's the microphone. If it rumbles, that's my breakfast.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "268b44768ff10275"}, "8a0d9d94": {"d": 3.69, "e": "BVvn9vLm7vvSSBdF9Ofa0Li0m0yYzcVfVlid+KxOQk8rCAMAGt7FgOXLnPfl7t3JtJ1Oq//cwKbt5LQ3ZLSnaz8v451hU09MKAo=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Hello up there in the cheap seats – is the volume all right like this?", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "f2b554c939ce46e7"}, "171e8eee": {"d": 4.367, "e": "AVRr+PjFe8f//NqV1v7V3c6XSG6Ile7QrlwfNCMJAwAAbvr127p8OmTw8drGtpVmwKJbNcv04c+Lo5KPztfOv5GGTJ1BUC5pt/aOSlzh0MSidVk9MTkVCQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "So, can you hear me at the back? Last row, just raise a hand if it's too quiet.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "6bdf8e1581b06342"}, "99a2263f": {"d": 6.029, "e": "BaHofeKNT1BIbf/r19TExbqWUGZ0O4Tit5hOJprh2bSAPaLYv5JZIC8UBQEAAACOysOuUlFe0dtTYN3JyMCJelt8gKLdw4w7OW7S4Md7QSmU6NnYl3xUMBAEAGXnhU1SKrWBuPbnyqRphlVhyvWTWjmEYC4/WEUfBg==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "If it's too loud at the front, move back. If it's too quiet at the back, move forward. That's the whole of acoustics.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d75baa760ee50801"}, "bb3c6f6d": {"d": 5.072, "e": "Dn3/79rQrldx1PHfwok8FTzGt0nYt2xv0dLRiq6ab920Z5uwg6a7zZQ9YaVWPLCFcWFWNBAEAAAAOsTCX+bGkW9x3MzQh3VrJqGegS1Vy4szsaGSknE+RsK/mlk+k9nHmGVKLxcL", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "One, two … I've been told I don't need a microphone. I've been told that by people in the front row.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d1f6b16797643b66"}, "4c236c9d": {"d": 5.31, "e": "Amr88cJyTG/svW8cBlKp0INXPbCUlmMXA4ilN8tz1r53M07O28rDudXJu55iZS7UvKOhfI3onFeOeVhVRBwEAQAAIG2w6dHpr2TN67NeeqPG69O7lVQoH2j/8OnVvZlgWorIv2xjWVEzFgg=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Grüß Gott – testing. If the back row nods, we're in business. … Very good, a nod. Two nods, even.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d88ae98192e1c7ef"}, "f63cbfb6": {"d": 5.341, "e": "DLenc+6fsP+hMzGl13R6oXSg/vPLxqayq9C7ZRoaGgkCAAAAG65z2bC22FJi0cZ6gm5YfN3M0Lqip5604+Pj2bF8cGhXMVfedlBPHdrMs5Zhc3px+c5QFXKYRUft1KdZUVms9cZraVhCKg4=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "The projector is warming up. It's a bit like a cow in the morning – it gets there, but not before it's ready.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "2ee30fe7d9d498b4"}, "56965a92": {"d": 4.42, "e": "D4L5/vDr8uXLy8u4hhZ+jEfOn5X/pCxQw7Sje1U5nuWzcDXJ555dnpiDWdvIx5BahFY3Mw0DAAABrOmRSPT+4vDiwHqjgWpehSh+qHJxuNnSrZp2YlZFFwg=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "One moment, the projector is still thinking about it. Like many of us at this hour.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "47aab0bb87ba41fc"}, "077327c1": {"d": 5.136, "e": "BLq4SFfc9pNLvsiMSJ90iVtQvsVxmKFzZ1EcBQAs2n+t/+PJ07VzvOJvQ14ulHuDcU5M5JhjnHZYRiEIAQABuK5Tt+3UyLireC2dyMLLw2mNU46SkG8sjNWpeVwRYaXJrZp6VDkfDA==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "It's looking for the signal. It always looks for the signal. It rarely finds it on the first try.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "bed1d449623f7560"}, "3ac58512": {"d": 5.595, "e": "EMjqw4fAzNPEljQk2/LKyJOn7MRsHB4RBGnhisPRqfC1Pa21j3NYVqzhxsKmlGJtoqiZVNHmw05ZtLKx0+jbtYFbWToUBgEAAAAY6N1Za//W5p41oP65Z0q50bd1k3NRab6QhH45fcQlM4KKbFcwDQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "While the lamp warms up, you can open the slides on BOKUlearn. That way at least one of us has a picture.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "277ca78026c286d3"}, "de69075e": {"d": 5.462, "e": "A8L7peThhojSzZE7PLzVmnTH8tnFklZet+zOwKawobrlzJJHNzcPAkzo0s3WjtqubaTgm0V6pZmni0t559m1g5JwOUbC0Ll+aY9uSVQzBAEAAJX/vcPQIwh+r3V8n/nbqkQp1vWrYXJvUEkuFwg=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Everything's plugged in … now we wait. In agriculture we call this patience. In IT they call it booting.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "7ac5ffe4f9265fe6"}, "0089ebe8": {"d": 3.871, "e": "CriYa9yGpPeYIiKOyp+328ShYV+msNPYh6iRmrq6v552W0Q8JAcCABSgVGNR/8B4p7K3wd/Ky6uOdDmF0qRvWV2PbTGu0MeBYWNSQRUI", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "The projector needs another moment – it's not a morning person either.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "9362f2a1704d2c58"}, "ed280605": {"d": 4.282, "e": "BcT486xocVPN/+jRpYqBgp6diWHh59KJKjwdadCvoGy14+XOmFaajmlYRxwIAQAAbeGc1ffXxsHckiFjmqqy1K1xNJzixHM4mpFbmNmFWo9iPDlBHwU=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Blue screen, then black, then blue again. I've learned not to read anything into it.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "4ba6551ca726e316"}, "e2826144": {"d": 6.599, "e": "DJXs/O3ZytLCv6FMl7x4VWPhzr6Tp42sYhvBv24wUcrAyqeWVVSOXoyVoObYsXhWPBQIAQAAAACZ42JVSifU4LF6dNvNz8VgkXt2iFZ8xcuMwrGSX2akrafHo3xqt9SpbE4mCgITr+/3/Jw/KsX/5Lujg36CbGdgjtzEroJcSzQ9SjIH", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Meanwhile I'll tell you what we're planning for today. That's the advantage of having it in your head and not only on the slides.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "82b25fab8189258f"}, "afdc4aef": {"d": 3.55, "e": "BL6kZ0Sz+c5+XZr81Hpzgb6Rf00UBBXC95ZQ/MFRv9JpmU6F3ON3N6aLe2CInNfK3en/zHCju2ZHoq2Zc1Z38syFWTUvJQ8=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "It's still searching. I'd offer it a coffee, but I need that myself.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "daa8e13081129466"}, "2cb7129e": {"d": 5.83, "e": "Cbv29uN+v81ZXNHjx31vraFbUxtFwP/2yZJyUU8rBgIAAAAh8qBAQtSii/mxOja2u5i1fUJJ6+fDrbTP1pKHhlNStsXl0ZdNKpGDdVo9Egmg3sBn6O1oM1qc0mkyx926iyRm7s2Gxdimqc3GkU5ge1lYPRwL", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "A little patience, please. This projector has seen a lot of semesters – and it lets you feel every one of them.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "caaf3b3db244d3ad"}, "f9bb689a": {"d": 4.015, "e": "Am3/3sZwXAqI7M6tViguG6Dg5OHdsJCrkmiVoZGF4tbKbI6fjolqZUgXBQBewHBqbbD0vme+Xk3e1cegclMhPlfVr7SWcZViuOzAfWBUMxYJ", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Grüß Gott, ladies and gentlemen. It's quarter past – so we begin.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "1699f67d13e850b4"}, "83aa0bcc": {"d": 6.682, "e": "Aaztg7n6/+jiw6SUnVlCqq2L6dCxTXGlmndWlx5S0ObTwKKPj5eonVxBbsaxeGxuYEYnDAIAAAAAAI3t4MqQTzd3dla2omdNhdrNy9O9xreQeGI6d4iAUSGMqnRWatbdu2Yzq4R7akYelYBYttLGuKB/Wy40vcu1n59nYaHmyq18Xk06HAs=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good morning and welcome to Animal Nutrition. Nice to see so many of you – on a Tuesday, at this hour, voluntarily.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "eeb01ae7082ea9bc"}, "4162f141": {"d": 5.352, "e": "AWP6/8ptSGXox5VALA2t65bU05ighmxXOBEFAAAAGNOtrZFexpDizt2GJCZJ39CIXL6fmH9+rufstWt6Wj0ggUaF08ZiU8GklHTGvrOwlZyqx9W9mWFMVVa4oqRkWKGHW0O41rWIZjgyMw0E", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Grüß Gott, everyone. The academic quarter is over, the coffee is in my mug, so we can start.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "7157ac3209d3a06e"}, "bd4f107e": {"d": 4.963, "e": "CaL/iqX17+PawZeBhExBvdDK4qWHw9bJwLyUXHSMZLugM4HgkrXXm56UdFkpvqWnimxjTlW+wmolQRwFAQAAAJX3yIhRKQ0tbfC8R1yR3LJ0PBgIn+K3rqCPb7zCoXFNQjETCA==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good morning! I'll wait a moment until everyone's found a seat … good. Coats off, brains on.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "774746600d7e772a"}, "e7a87a33": {"d": 7.812, "e": "AKL/kbb9++ndyZyUgCpEtd7g2rFsopdtWIeac5zrz6tSkXt3ZVJBGAcBAAAAAC7r58hhg83Qm07Rp1EeR4OJt1hf4vHjxq620YoeKnS3qG8lW8BsSVXmtKByxN3EhE5yUV6Qd2I5pW/DjJnKt2tZX57F0MmqmI99WcSkaxad9OO9cTBXTRADAGHPhGAp26JaIZDi0Kp6XE09TT0PBQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good morning, ladies and gentlemen. Welcome back to the only lecture at this university that is entirely about lunch – just not ours.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "56cb1e0edddedd7c"}, "10d45fd1": {"d": 5.601, "e": "AGn/37NqHo/ew5M2JyEpULW2t3Q/wdPn1se8kXIyM9fHn1dHdlxHSikGAQAlUtCzyt7pwpyOf4BgLgYKnLelRDzB49iPcpupsMCtaTV5m5q8vbGgi1FTi5F0WJrGZntkWbPUrpuEZzhNUd6tZkIpDwM=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Grüß Gott! Some familiar faces, some new ones – and a few I mostly know from the cafeteria queue.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d706fbeac369d8b3"}, "3fee41bb": {"d": 6.354, "e": "C4fs2MuAOy1IzNZrsODh1MuocFNGJwsCAAAAKNv/7saxoZliQzvUtndmcdC8tpmYlouIaihL08u2bEQuya2ebWVKSsh0NgpSoMbBwJMpNWp3VB0HARmNTpDiwcG4cqqXhGlZT8PJtq2MYF+WZKKzqsmEjItwv8CfSU9hRjwoEAU=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Right, good morning. Anyone still coming in, please find a seat quietly – the cows on the slides are already waiting.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "06e48f8eecaa1df9"}, "12964118": {"d": 5.139, "e": "BK3uirv7/+vkx52FjVYPa8yKZ2S9u5ZdzI29RRt0gq7rvJxsIYzHiWS5s4bCnnBSa+2UOIyicm2UoqzX4LN1bk0nCQIAAAWYxaLS2EwywJFdq69wwp5Aeq/JZjOHZD9oyOSZYkgiDA==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good morning. I've cycled up the hill, I've had my coffee, I'm ready. I hope you've had your coffee too.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d6c3df32b058a2ed"}, "6ad1f91a": {"d": 6.134, "e": "Amn/7cdxXQl799SkTSQxQr+vd/Ksc9ru6NnHkV1QPRwHAQAAAABV37z709XLjp+Lafa4Wk3W18esi3dlho1mqflvnpHHvIcqMzTK+eiCQGu5uNbK1sZdZqqzzLKFRzhQIGvEz/Tn7IulaI52f52GWE94N4TYtUoXOiIK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Grüß Gott and good morning. Today is a good day – we talk about food for ninety minutes, and nobody has to cook.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "2319b56a1fa860e2"}, "0b51d1fb": {"d": 5.951, "e": "AaX/iK/+/u/cwZeKhpC40+Dbtm+aiWV4j4qA39TCWpWDemdWRyYJAQAAAB2b2cbY4ZS8qaprU1DFwsy9h3E9Jgxl3NnVkLnhx5dVLy4LDJfX4fCVJUpQrsiVfiRzPXLPzb+deZqZZjeHr4hmLVOhfeTJmGRIMBAK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good morning, ladies and gentlemen. Phones on silent, pens out – and let's see what the cow has for us today.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "690fca5a9a8a3756"}, "5bdc63b6": {"d": 7.49, "e": "CaLij4X78vCq0biPR+vUvEuWe7fMtJlbi5Pt27OIZ0ZQvb2x1OvTy4dZhOaORRZn44ZhOpKKMRYzDQMAAAAAABOWaan+zuXytkEXTYRbb7/8yntRrtHEgW6llYWMakK/vNLKwMObTbiXHVPowna/x5uN/8FRFCoUBQ2WtNnIy9+zQQ9coNKrVZGWgIuKgJy6mmxRPSIK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "I came by bike again today, from the nineteenth district. The climb up to Türkenschanze reminds me every week that I'm not twenty any more.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "97297e17350ef678"}, "4d56c51b": {"d": 5.592, "e": "EDD/t5LmyKJhp+nSq2VirJ92OjPJt7quj3NgPRQEAAMiV9KzZoJJP6Ho3bZiQ2tfTiwMAwAAAAS15NKiVy+isKmkrJaLqruzpId/aWKvm4mBXEKmuIErOWLhnEaBn4dir4pKJn6Vma3JwYtgSj0iCQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Who here grew up on a farm? … Quite a few of you. Good – then I have allies when I start talking about manure.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "378342b5da8523fa"}, "2d411707": {"d": 7.436, "e": "CafFsmGT76xJr86+297JtXlRe6KGiUlrzdHStl+srpNlQTEtCQIAAbvCRlMRTejV5JZUoIliKAlnr0pZGrb/69eau3GgoJNKWax0veRyJE2yp2dpzshvZeTIkUVeO3nnnXXEhmFRtODXg5R2Sl3Twr6PYFU/GggAAAAAAB3k1G6riLndnjtJqUtDm5yY7MKMYE85Hgs=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "My coffee mug has a cow on it. It's dented, it's older than the projector, and it works every single time. Make of that what you will.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "aae4b76b5b59ba14"}, "32856830": {"d": 7.339, "e": "CbTX5cPt4uGpOJKdnq+HhPnTkT4vLw0DAAAASabu3IxhfOf26uC7nlCJoj5v68hXtnbLr31Cr01D1Nvnl7nIfml6e1hx4s7GpJJ9LD/Kpoi6aXj0r0txsYLcplSJomCR04pRxLx2aNHivmlKqqGFbU48SSIFAQAAAE7b383Vr2LM0dDAoXFJQAPR/9SJYExNRykH", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "My wife is a vet. So at home I talk about what goes into the cow, and she talks about what happens afterwards. Very balanced dinners.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "7fbe906abd9bfafc"}, "231a0efb": {"d": 7.263, "e": "Bc7OwXiDr821mUN+aurXsmu6l4ttUajpydO9oVAXbdbBnIRvQwgCcNjq/9TQ2ZG2ql8+nZqTpb+zYYumZpMwvMJrrINaad+yWGZtk2NEEAYBAAAAAAAi0vNCuPbj4cd/eqClnSQJN+jQs46Hi0YUiMljcedjPSo/5dbLk6d2YCWzwJZZVatl5MW2clxiY00zFAw=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Both of our children are grown up now, and neither of them went into agriculture. An error in upbringing – I take full responsibility.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "be65d4d8b2e320f4"}, "1d2f5297": {"d": 8.825, "e": "BpHg2d/z0XdcOay5nnaSg6fu39OqhI2Yc5HCknHY4baTgGt/Yz/C37VhL2enf0UvGwcBAACd8s5zNCzg2MduprZ7Mx2VnDULbNLorjiqt7a0eJSkcFfGwX9VgFo3DgMAAAAAAAHB/+LMdnDi6N2N14kuFHyfWd6sXz1SuZOGdTEHAXbRw63o0+PU0+jZsqKMeLzMekV0bjCZ4rJ8Tzv32K2jm4l6en9eW9PcoWhOMxoH", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "I once spent a year in Brazil as a postdoc, on a feedlot with two thousand cattle. When I came back to Austria, I very nearly hugged the first meadow I saw.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "eb024e714606d886"}, "3b5ee0e9": {"d": 6.846, "e": "BKuXZ4LknpbTuFh1s+jOyKWfuZ80DZXPpn1jSBsHAQAAAGKikP/Swreuzr16Q7vTu41aU6Wus8S4u7Kfg0mY44U+bKLbrXEyd6emx+vIc5WAZ1odBgAAAEzJtWu+tFF62+WkKymqcyBfavHhyrBZM5DVvbR3odKNTZxyb42Zj2AyNuKbTh1DJAg=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "It's getting chilly out there. The cows on pasture mind that much less than we do – cattle cope with cold far better than with heat.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "f7f5723a55289af0"}, "3019ea37": {"d": 9.168, "e": "AqX/qbyww8zvfjxVxMeyp5CbkJ11yKxbbJSXkInCyNfedoJlPE5pWUQeC7K/qqZyV8DozbWWTRYXDgQAAAAACTbdtmWchk6C2rS1dqeto45oLi6+tLWgjFyuqFYpJouydlpJJgcBAAAAOJmt2r7BfbfE1cXToFmEZ1Kq0rZrOmSUVk3Q3cDBkHq/t62IcG5RCxjh23RZj7KIPjPatLKRjFdXwLd5alRuYT5Rb36CUjOmx5ttTj8UBw==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Over the weekend I was up in the Weinviertel, where I grew up. Thirty cows on our farm back then. Today the neighbours mostly grow wine – also fermentation, to be fair.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "90ddbae148a1342b"}, "11132683": {"d": 7.13, "e": "DdPwxoE8mP/evPSQMlWKwoN4aJNhUsrM0rJpPD+Vk7bNsYRhSSAJAQAAAACVw5/H5Gspo3SkvpDb0ZNHMcbAw7qFla7PkSU4e65nmPDNn31zUkQSAwCH5syVcMe7WZNmZJj22M2liG5iShoDiq53pKhsJZru4r1vvqNXeqGeobiimIp0NW3urENZbEI5GwY=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "We're a few weeks into the semester now. I hope you can all find the lecture halls – and the cafeteria, which is arguably more important.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "fb810a022356d562"}, "764ced4f": {"d": 7.823, "e": "Bre8rrO5ydnIuaqEZ5xMidnUwaSCXjk+alU7VejKln0rl/fmvZdpaF0oBgFHlltDOd3Gx8nNYjm+nU2PW0ery19DkGs+fG58Z1Aqpf+Yq2JuxlJEpXizmoZTq8u6dW5gZVEzFgQAAAAAAAADuZ+m6qZZs8aqj2Gwu8CmpqzE09GZUX14Uxgk5dbLtHY4csWlNTxLXtq4mXRaRC8XBg==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "By the way, the ÖH, the student union, is still looking for people for the student representation. The details are on the notice board outside.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "15e94d26cbfe04c5"}, "2d66af19": {"d": 4.332, "e": "FcS3Veb92ODM3ObYfdvQxax8aTppf8osS4D/0lljwLF6IyIUBwEAAGz8uz9Lst/QspZkYuLTsElBebnV18q3eaWrq9DtsH50W0B85OvngWZGbnBaRScN", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Before we move on, a quick recap. Not for my sake – I know it already. Mostly.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "509b247635b151ce"}, "099a8a7a": {"d": 4.785, "e": "AqCzZOvpr2A3vP+xRFndrFUVGAkCAAXmzlCna27dn39ot5lXgHAht8vgxn21rpxlgdTp3tG7nGtiVjMLAoTfuqd23N7DzNWdqqN5Z35FbW1Foql8U2R96M+ogFpFLB0L", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "A brief recap. Repetition is the mother of learning – and the grandmother of the exam.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "bf0cf252520c4087"}, "087370d7": {"d": 6.663, "e": "BJbj08GQUUOd/dJVLCqgk2NXzdrGo2mJlrJPhODbz7WMeWFhf7Sv1MmYnJqBoqyLTQ+m24XCsld6lJKKr7RVL1qhpJ18Syop1teufl1ENw0EAAAAAACD125OTCGqcj5P6+LPoWRPacrb1tCflGRKtOWfk5VmSE/fzKBKcoX/qV9DS0o8DgU=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Last week we saw that an animal can never use everything that's in the feed. That's the thread running through this whole course.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "30a068b7c48ac2b2"}, "da686ad4": {"d": 6.052, "e": "CcnKYvDSc8b+sk5uqHNZgtvU3biafmZbUVAxBgIAYrBe+unTkVby4cbQzrqbYx5o1Lyklpew6Nm4h1w+FwgCAAAAMtRpreur/+nLkEQpq+jYfTua+fbdlKOVi4pFY7W11uyiUFR5Xl562b24kVdTr9fRkVdpb1Q1DgQ=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Let me briefly summarise. If you were here last time, nod. If you weren't, nod anyway, and read the slides later.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "1ae86c36de814c31"}, "cb7c9bbd": {"d": 6.502, "e": "DEfZrcLj3sBlRtaouNCZUz2m37W1vKWVbkc6g//MaB0sHwYCAAA8m2hise3Bw7mZXICfoZqCPdLbn0lNtJSkvKx7VkogCQEAO8WmyeTov2VKyZW80bCGWBYES49fXZ7kwsW1cV+hPJbusFVNtJCEj4lPq8/ESk6SmZWqs5FiSD8jDQM=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "For those who weren't here last week: the slides are on BOKUlearn. For those who were: the slides are also on BOKUlearn.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "0416074d8da1d355"}, "b15238ee": {"d": 6.701, "e": "CpCnjZDyyW9R2eJNMBfJzqdbKB4IAQAAGLj/66Fvnt/WuJLYwV9deTtn4biRWzYVCEKmv5VNvbe11NFoTkGvhll158vDi9LCoV0kgd/tx3IjPzil8um6XDkyCxLB8s2OYFhRMYzIravH6byDUipj0ramaCW3sl0kTXR2dj1o6MmQX1Q7LgkD", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "A short look back. Feed goes in at the front, something useful comes out – milk, meat, eggs – and the rest goes back to the field.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "47fa7eca7c0d583d"}, "7ff5b31f": {"d": 6.745, "e": "A7r973Bqqbd6VVmcxKlpuumuYEPW5ZeqcFGxsMvXzLeAVQ9i08e5hGpNJQkBAAAQlv3/3beDXSkOBAAn7eXW2tGuejDdwobfmjirp6KYiGYRgY3r372WcSGlwLzX2smagJ2dsKbC3dPSi2VYTU8pBBS+7MicYmPb2auDZTOe6bR1UElMFioH", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Any questions left over from last time? … No? Then either everything was clear, or nobody remembers. I'll assume the first.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "a4f6e718a1fbcd91"}, "734e5b65": {"d": 6.364, "e": "AF/AvD5PpP/YYljXzYcxQl2ly77QycOdgZxqlZc5VWLf4bd5TUw4Kg8EAAAAe8OJUkDlyJ9KONnIy7iroJaAVCoq0NDBtXCYmYU2Wiuv0rSsiExHptmcnX0uqN3Xx5BwWk85DwMAAGLbxvC+uaNiusSEUTaGQC+p3qhrLTQxEAg=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Quick recap, so nobody gets lost: we're still following the feed on its way through the animal. We haven't lost it yet.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "26eeda86d042ed42"}, "5238cae9": {"d": 6.401, "e": "A05j4NDC1OChw7Wif1hEp8TLuo93aDsQBQAFv9hjRVEkjtf/1MfGokkokrieWl8v4ObEh1Q/GQYBAAAACpthmO3JxsFzyrN/PZ1pKmu8JpfQx7unhlcwx7J8wYpYysOsnYp0oWNctbG70bi7jmlnUVjHrIVBepG12694SiotKwwE", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "So, where do we stand? Let's chew on it once more. The cow does that for hours every day – we can manage half a minute.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "4d3c23bf83108455"}, "5e1d9f3c": {"d": 3.731, "e": "DLnWbNLWZEzN3sODlHUxT+vmvHFXOZR50tqIk25ApJus29DPuXplRjkNBAAAgbhWwv/PyYdlrc/Ajp2ouIQ5XUuk9M+TXCZCPhsJ", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Let me pull the threads together for a moment, before we tie the next knot.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "b1a1e8fa84261662"}, "9be9dfd3": {"d": 1.588, "e": "CG//vu330dLHrq7LqXFdSsz83bFSOrbCg3JQPjIrIA8=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Today we'll start with", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "6f64de783b3b98c7"}, "5c1c2074": {"d": 2.597, "e": "DZrz/+/X2tKqYUtS5LOjh6+tZiYx3cG3pYJZgTldYse5sqlpR16/xsTQt3pjdVRHSEEuCQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "– and then we'll see how far the cow carries us.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "026c3e1fb9e2299a"}, "924d3782": {"d": 2.005, "e": "DCh2/927kmZSQ6iwuaNQOmLjztx/gb+hhXp9WViidMfJtoVcTjsnDws=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "First on the programme today:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "2440a66f84bcbec9"}, "85184e97": {"d": 3.845, "e": "AVDC7M1sStqYx+K6XkNHc9tqGyDJsplWSzbaxnUiHBiUp2Oxfd3fikd5pdrT0bCQmWSi38WreHB+g2lPIwcAPFxg/+Xg7MWUcF1MLxQ=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". After that, step by step – like a good change of ration: slowly.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "c9f15adb6103662b"}, "849bf5ba": {"d": 1.336, "e": "EXX//rqY0H1y7+HItp+TouLQpHxIRERCMh4K", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "We begin with", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "7f11158a7b9b8d1e"}, "b1b7ccd1": {"d": 4.024, "e": "AECD/I9USULce+vo6p5YkrlwUYnJNsH/otrOeZfGvLCuiisqKKjs4du/jXJrYlg9CgMDteGfrbVy4NyGXyuv69bMomxrMCPl2K59S01NQhsH", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". It's the basis for everything that follows – like a good forage base.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "23eb5049f7f461c8"}, "ec84ef6d": {"d": 3.778, "e": "BI/k0FpYwvTX4cuGr/XRxqPJwLLS99hyLS+HpmrAkuvjyJ6CTwwF4Z4rZ+T6/7ZhLqN3Z4CCb1IhBiPfpm9C3tfPkE09q4dqPikbCw==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "I've planned rather a lot for today. Optimistically. We start with", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "f60842b501a9679d"}, "d408e45e": {"d": 1.032, "e": "EYTb/7VGZo3u7n+d2KWRekpELBoO", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Let's look at", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "a02b0ff191e0bc6d"}, "ddcf1c57": {"d": 4.018, "e": "DixJ+dLFpmtTKx2VqDtyqe3d5sO3yM7EsZmBUofHhZ/l1rjXqj8duv/dv3dYNAsDAABpq/Hc2NCwzfaoiaKUjFrZs2+nhYGdu9e8hV9EKxMJ", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "first. If time allows, we'll do a lot more. Time usually doesn't allow.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "22eebf6b18e69e4d"}, "50008d45": {"d": 1.628, "e": "C23/31l7zXhpprbGzMV/TDA0KEWikLrXyq57YVdKLRgK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Top of the list today:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "c9cb7397835a4dce"}, "ee033770": {"d": 1.963, "e": "CkZwZf/n0rq52dPM08CbiURS1Ys3U8K7k0lDtOTEhUyScFE9NSkTCw==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". So – now it gets important.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "ae0d2f54b4783825"}, "e0629584": {"d": 1.298, "e": "CSxJ/+bKn28+iE2o1syyTljEknlzZGlCJA0=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "First item:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "8bf840482f80599d"}, "3032d98b": {"d": 4.095, "e": "BCVEhv/owpA60NWiOpWyp8TY0crCqoqHTSKrqoWIpMbe0as7SnhTkKzWwXlaUCI2BwMAAEC64Ovsw4izb66mKx1MZv7bs3pas8bQu1xlWE0pDQ==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". Please don't be alarmed by the length of the list – I never get through it either.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "a5fb1c57e9022d90"}, "602925c7": {"d": 1.927, "e": "DzbR/+G4djjBXlai6NHOuZSBYGSwkV5LvN/EmFA7pI1yTC8vJxYN", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Here's the plan. We start with", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "5bc311118f0bd983"}, "52041e3a": {"d": 3.293, "e": "Blm11bvOtf/aoV5DKW+jgcDDw6yHYldO1cnArYp1TicOBAF61lF53dnt2crev52NgXeamm+KVU7M2aeGU0RFPysJ", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ", and the rest is on the slide. It's a menu, not a promise.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "b46c083e997f30ed"}, "e12a5b08": {"d": 1.61, "e": "B672gUHj/7dCrsWucWTJiLfi1sC6sJCfemZXPjM4JRMK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "We open today with", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d35b8cc7bbd9beda"}, "84537f48": {"d": 3.278, "e": "BTUfvf/e5ZJp0fTZj7eTcDILEcDRak+fpGklqktJu9e9bDlBu5iWmVK457y6qGxbqZyg0bdzFEvU272TbVFEMhoK", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". Pens ready – this is the part you'll be glad you wrote down.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "28c01e7389104235"}, "0eb64c55": {"d": 1.603, "e": "Dzyo/a7/28bJqW4/L9bQuos4NHXO4MSLXFNAU1JBLAsF", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Today's first course:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "988510ffb0aa4d43"}, "b50e2d33": {"d": 3.149, "e": "BmPd+Nvz37Jfmun316tpWj5116WpuojK/8tSN4CNPDnz486xhXpWHAWp2I7s2kAZr6BAjr/e7aVWimxURSoP", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": ". Main course and dessert to follow, projector permitting.", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d441d28392c7127d"}, "b75f8874": {"d": 2.246, "e": "BzWk/+rXkF5IjNOQQTvs4NjJgLeWai9Ekp6vx5NAVD4qYt6qQoBwRCs1Kh0N", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Good. That brings us to the next topic:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "d461e689b7383ed1"}, "ef97e9d0": {"d": 3.939, "e": "AmzF4nkmLsujYcLBpGe4s5FOqHeeyKeTusa+rot8az41yMXP4+KzkXONcK7Kq6GlvsXEe1VrfGNdOg0DAAABof/FSlxWWUWk0oxaFyUdDA==", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "Keep that in the back of your mind – we'll need it again later. Next stop:", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "2840dac82f09e172"}, "ae0bc632": {"d": 2.933, "e": "AU5k6f/l4spdUHA1xIPY0MKHQy4eBie/7+/31sK6pI5hYIk4jszP08iWp3k0M03PurODWj94dl1HHAw=", "s": "prof", "k": "part", "t": "So much for that. And now, a change of pasture –", "v": "kokoro:bm_daniel", "sha": "568233a58d0a45b7"}}